"Experimental mode."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:27
msgid "Quiet Drive"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:28
msgid ""
"TOP will display alerts but only play the most important warning sounds. "
"This feature can be toggled while the car is on."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:30
msgid "Driving Screen Off"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:31
msgid ""
"Turn off the device screen to protect the OLED panel after driving starts. "
"It automatically brightens or turns on when a touch or event occurs."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:34
msgid "Lateral Controls Always On"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:35
msgid ""
"Lateral control will always be on and will not be interrupted by braking."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:37
msgid "NNFF Torque Control"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:38
msgid ""
"Use Twilsonco's Neural Network Feedforward torque system for more precise "
"lateral control.\n"
"Changing this setting will restart openpilot."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:41
msgid "Disable Steering Delay Learning"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:42
msgid ""
"Keep the fixed default steering delay instead of learning the delay of the "
"car while driving. Turn on for cars whose steering wheel sticks: the learned "
"delay comes out too long and the steering can wobble.\n"
"Always on with NNFF Torque Control, which uses the fixed delay. Takes effect "
"on the next drive."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:46
msgid "Lane Centering Correction"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:47
msgid ""
"When the driving model keeps the car off the middle of a marked lane, "
"cutting curves or hugging a line, steer it back toward the lane centre. Only "
"from 45 km/h (full from 60 km/h) in normal-width lanes: off in alleys and "
"slow streets, during lane changes, while you steer and where the lane lines "
"are faint. Takes effect on the next drive."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:52
msgid "Stop And Go"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:53
msgid "Enabled the Stop And Go feature and get auto hold."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:55
msgid "Enable Experiment Mode In SNG"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:56
msgid ""
"When vehicle is stopped, enable experiment mode to prevent radar misjudgment "
"of other moving vehicles that could cause continuous forward sliding."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:59
msgid "TSS-P Longitudinal Tuning"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:60
msgid ""
"Using the longitudinal tuning can improve the smoothness on Toyota TSS-P "
"models when equipped with SDSU for longitudinal control."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:62
msgid "Dynamic Distance Adjustment"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:63
msgid ""
"The distance to the lead car will no longer be a fixed reaction time, but "
"will be dynamically adjusted based on the speed of the vehicle."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:66
msgid "Smooth Stops"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:67
msgid ""
"Eases off the brake in the final moments of a stop for a gentle landing. "
"Planned braking is never softened. Requires openpilot longitudinal control."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:70
msgid "Blinker Lane Change"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:71
msgid ""
"Change lanes without the need to nudge the steering wheel first.\n"
"Disabled: Need to nudge the steering wheel to change lanes.\n"
"Enabled: Nudgeless.\n"
"Speed limit: Normal mode: above 20mph, Enabled Lateral Controls Always On: "
"above 35mph."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:75
msgid "Edge Detection During Lane Changes"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:76
msgid ""
"When the system detects obstacles at the vehicle's edge, lane change assist "
"functionality will be temporarily suspended.\n"
"NOTE: This will show 'Car Detected in Blindspot' warning."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:79
msgid "Vision Based Turn Control"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:80
msgid ""
"Use vision path predictions to estimate the appropriate speed to drive "
"through turns ahead."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:82
msgid "Map Based Turn Control"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:83
msgid ""
"Use map data to estimate the appropriate speed to drive through turns ahead."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:85
msgid "Enable Local File Server"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:86
msgid ""
"This will allow you to play or download openpilot driving record files "
"through your browser.\n"
"Use web interface to control it: http://[device_ip]:8082\n"
"Internet access from mobile phone (tethering) is required."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:90
msgid "Use Toyota Stock Longitudinal Control"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:91
msgid "Enable to use Toyota's stock longitudinal control."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:93
msgid "Enable Toyota Drive Mode Button"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:94
msgid ""
"TOP will link the Acceleration Personality to the car's physical drive mode "
"selector.\n"
"Reboot Required."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:96
msgid "Enable Door Auto Lock"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:97
msgid ""
"Enabled this to lock doors when drive above 25 km/h. Only work on some "
"Toyota vehicles."
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:99
msgid "Enable Door Auto Unlock"
msgstr ""

#: selfdrive/ui/layouts/settings/top.py:100
msgid ""
"Enabled this to unlock doors when shift to gear P. Only work on some Toyota "
